# Home-style vegetarian tiffins, delivered daily

Fresh lunch from our Baner kitchen to your office or home in Pune

Started in 2019, now serving 240 tiffins every day

**[Start a weekly plan](https://wa.me/919876543210)**

## What makes our tiffins special

We cook home-style vegetarian meals in a kitchen in Baner, Pune. Each tiffin includes 4 rotis, one dry sabzi, one dal or curry, rice and a sweet on Sundays.

We use cold-pressed groundnut oil and never add ajinomoto. Lunch reaches your door between 12:00 and 1:00 pm, orders for the next day close at 8 pm.

## Our service at a glance

- **Daily changing menu**: Menu updates every day and is posted on WhatsApp at 9 pm. Jain meals available at the same price.
- **Flexible plans**: Weekly plan (6 lunches) for Rs 780 or monthly plan (26 lunches) for Rs 3,200. Pause your plan for free with 1 day notice.
- **Easy ordering**: Pay by UPI at the start of your plan. Order or ask questions on WhatsApp at 98765 43210.

